The agent successfully fixed the misleading "jq not available" warning when Claude outputs JSON objects. The root cause was correctly identified: `_extract_text_from_json` in `sw-loop.sh` only handled JSON arrays (`[`), not objects (`{`), causing valid JSON objects to be treated as unparseable and showing a false "jq not available" warning.

